<title>UK: Hanil Bank mandates BayerLB for 300 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Hanil Bank mandates BayerLB for 300 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Korea's Hanil Bank has mandated Bayerische Landesbank to lead manage a 300 million mark three-year Eurobond, BayerLB said on Friday.</p>
<p>The deal will be launched early next week. No further details were available.</p>
<p>Hanil Bank tapped the international capital markets last October with a $200 million three-year FRN. The deal paid a coupon of six-month Libor plus 21 basis points.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
